"california_privacy_choices" = "California Privacy Choices";
"california_privacy_choices_primary_text" = "Limit the Use of Sensitive Personal Information";
"california_privacy_choices_secondary_text" = "I would like Snap to limit the use of my sensitive personal information (including precise geolocation). This setting only applies to users living in California.";
"florida_privacy_choices" = "Florida Privacy Choices";
"florida_privacy_choices_primary_text" = "Limit the Use of Information for Personalized Ads";
"florida_privacy_choices_secondary_text" = "No two people are the same, so that’s why we personalize ads. For example, if you watch a lot of sports content, and we observe that you don’t like hair and makeup tips, the app may personalize ads by prioritizing sports and skipping those makeup tips. If this setting is enabled (i.e., toggle “on” to disable ads) and you live in Florida, we will not show personalized ads based on your activities on Snapchat and other apps or websites. Instead, we will rely on other signals to show you ads, like your language, your age, and your state. These ads will be more random and less relevant to your interests. Learn more.";